    say\u0131s\u0131d\u0131r. Ortaya \xE7\u0131karaca\u011F\u0131n de\u011Ferler
    hem kendi gelece\u011Fine \u0131\u015F\u0131k tutup umut olabilir hem de \xE7evren
    taraf\u0131ndan takdir toplayabilir. Bug\xFCn g\xFCzel i\u015Fler yapacaks\u0131n
    bence."
